  "table_intro": [
    "# BPPLIB instance table",
    "",
    "One row per instance in this environment: the 90 public practice instances at `/app/instances/` plus the 6,216 additional library instances at `/app/library/` (the two sets do not overlap).",
    "",
    "- `best` — the BPPLIB-registered best value: a single number when the registered best lower bound equals the best upper bound (a proven optimum), otherwise `lb..ub`.",
    "- `ffd` — bins used by the shipped First-Fit Decreasing baseline; `gap` = `ffd` − `best upper bound`.",
    ""
